==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**4 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Le'noir might seem intimidating, but his very slow attack rate means you use units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]], etc., to sneak in hits before he nukes your cats. [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]] is useful as a general tank for the Darks and Kaijin, and their [[Yellow Strike (Combo)|Wave Immunity combo]] prevents [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] from getting sniped by Malizabeth's Waves. Additionally, the Shadow Boxer Ks falter against high damage units, such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]].

